  "description": "K-way external merge sort for .NET 8. Sort datasets larger than available memory using parallel chunk sorting and binary min-heap merge. v1.0.6 shares one estimated item-memory budget across a bounded pool of reusable chunk buffers, with cancellation-aware waits and worker cleanup on failure. Includes parallel multi-pass merge, Knuth's Replacement Selection, Int64 record counts and sort metrics. Generic IExternalSorter<T> — plug in any record type, comparer, and serializer.",
