  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.6: MaxMemoryBytes is now a global estimated item-memory budget for chunk creation. Parallel sorting uses bounded reusable buffers; cancellation and failures drain workers before cleanup. Public API and binary format are unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md for budget exclusions and compatibility details.",
